you paid me.", "name": "VINNIE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's all there is?", "name": "ROZ", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's all there ever was.", "name": "VINNIE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "She lowers the gun.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "The clock keeps ticking, in pieces.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}